    <description>RESEARCH-ONLY / UNVERIFIED TunerPro definition for Porsche 986 Boxster S 3.2L ME7.2 ECU.
ROM 91003718 / y966ohc.ori. Sourced from data/calibration/canonical_me72_registry.json.
TRUST POLICY: All semantic names, units, axes, and scaling formulas are PROPOSED/INFERRED,
not verified against target execution. Raw byte values are observed_target only where
image/span evidence matches. No operational or tuning approval is implied.
- 1-based TunerPro categories matching official Bosch engineering hierarchy.
- Proper 1D line curve vs 3D surface matrix sizing (no blown-out grids).
- Bilingual German &amp; English hover descriptions (proposed, not verified).
- Byte order: Motorola/big-endian via mmedtypeflags (0x00-0x03).
Status: research-only/unverified — do not use for production tuning.</description>
