    <title>KLFNWSN_122CE - Kennlinie KLFNWSN_122CE (NWS) (1D Curve KLFNWSN_122CE (NWS))</title>
    <description>The calling function computes a signed difference (in_RL5 - in_RL4) clamped to [-128,127] and uses it as an index into the 6-byte table, consistent with a VarioCam NWS correction factor lookup indexed by camshaft position error. The byte values (0x80–0xB5 range with one zero) represent signed correction factors in 1/256 scale typical of Bosch NWS actuator compensation curves in the ME7.2 NWS cluster.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="5"/>
    <XDFAXIS id="x">
      <units>Index / Point</units>
      <indexcount>6</indexcount>
      <decimalpl>0</decimalpl>
