  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x55" flags="0x0">
    <title>KLFNWSN_122D6 - Kennlinie KLFNWSN_122D6 (NWS) (1D Curve KLFNWSN_122D6 (NWS))</title>
    <description>The calling function computes a difference index (in_RL5 - in_RL4) clamped to [0,127] and performs a RAM table lookup, a pattern consistent with NWS Befehlstest correction where commanded vs. actual VarioCam position deviation is mapped to an angular offset. The 6-point curve with mixed-sign values (positive and negative) aligns with a speed-dependent camshaft angle correction factor (KLFNWSN) used in the NWS actuator control loop within the safety-monitor cluster.</description>
