  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x5b" flags="0x0">
    <title>KFMIOP - Kennfeld optimales Motormoment (Optimal Engine Torque Map (Inverse Model))</title>
    <description>KFMIOP - Kennfeld optimales Motormoment (Load to Torque)

GERMAN: Gegenstueck zu KFMIRL. Berechnet das indizierte Motormoment bei optimalem Zuendwinkel (Zuendhaken-Scheitelpunkt) aus der tatsaechlichen Fuellung.
ENGLISH: Inverse torque model. Calculates theoretical engine torque output from actual cylinder air filling. Must be tuned in lockstep with KFMIRL to prevent torque intervention limp modes.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="3"/>
    <XDFAXIS id="x">
      <units>rl (load %)</units>
      <indexcount>16</indexcount>
      <decimalpl>2</decimalpl>
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedaddress="0x106dd" mmedelementsizebits="8" mmedmajorstridebits="8"/>
      <embedinfo type="1"/>
      <MATH equation="0.75*X">
        <VAR id="X"/>
      </MATH>
    </XDFAXIS>
    <XDFAXIS id="y">
      <units>nmot (RPM)</units>
      <indexcount>16</indexcount>
      <decimalpl>2</decimalpl>
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedaddress="0x10682" mmedelementsizebits="8" mmedmajorstridebits="8"/>
      <embedinfo type="1"/>
      <MATH equation="40*X">
        <VAR id="X"/>
      </MATH>
    </XDFAXIS>
    <XDFAXIS id="z">
      <units>% optimal torque</units>
      <decimalpl>2</decimalpl>
      <min>0.0</min>
      <outputtype>1</outputtype>
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedaddress="0x14376" mmedelementsizebits="16" mmedrowcount="16" mmedcolcount="16" signed="0" lsbfirst="1"/>
      <MATH equation="0.0015258789*X">
        <VAR id="X"/>
      </MATH>
    </XDFAXIS>
  </XDFTABLE>
  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x5c" flags="0x0">
    <title>KFMSNWDK - Kennfeld normierter Massenstrom ueber Drosselklappe (Normalized Air Mass Flow Over Throttle Body (BGMSZS))</title>
    <description>KFMSNWDK - Kennfeld normierter Massenstrom ueber Drosselklappe

GERMAN: Theoretischer Luftmassenstrom ueber die Drosselklappe abhaengig von Oeffnungswinkel (wdkbab_w) und Drehzahl (nmot_w).
ENGLISH: Physical throttle outflow mapping table. Translates throttle blade opening angle into calculated mass airflow. Crucial table when upgrading to a larger GT3 74mm/82mm throttle body.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="2"/>
    <XDFAXIS id="x">
      <units>wdkba (throttle %)</units>
      <indexcount>6</indexcount>
      <decimalpl>2</decimalpl>
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedaddress="0x15156" mmedelementsizebits="16" mmedmajorstridebits="-16" mmedtypeflags="0x02"/>
      <embedinfo type="1"/>
      <MATH equation="0.023438*X">
        <VAR id="X"/>
      </MATH>
    </XDFAXIS>
    <XDFAXIS id="y">
      <units>nmot (RPM)</units>
      <indexcount>16</indexcount>
      <decimalpl>2</decimalpl>
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedaddress="0x15176" mmedelementsizebits="16" mmedmajorstridebits="-16" mmedtypeflags="0x02"/>
      <embedinfo type="1"/>
      <MATH equation="0.25*X">
        <VAR id="X"/>
      </MATH>
    </XDFAXIS>
    <XDFAXIS id="z">
      <units>kg/h</units>
      <decimalpl>2</decimalpl>
      <min>0.0</min>
      <outputtype>1</outputtype>
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedaddress="0x15182" mmedelementsizebits="16" mmedrowcount="16" mmedcolcount="6" signed="0" lsbfirst="1"/>
      <MATH equation="0.1*X">
        <VAR id="X"/>
      </MATH>
    </XDFAXIS>
  </XDFTABLE>
  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x5d" flags="0x0">
    <title>KLAF - Ausflusskennlinie der Drosselklappe (501 Punkte) (Throttle Body Discharge Outflow Characteristic (501 Points))</title>
    <description>KLAF - Ausflusskennlinie der Drosselklappe

GERMAN: Stroemungsbeiwert der Drosselklappe in Abhaengigkeit vom Druckverhaeltnis vor und nach der Drosselklappe.
ENGLISH: Aerodynamic discharge coefficient of the throttle body valve over 501 pressure ratio steps. Governs manifold model filling dynamics.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="2"/>
